WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:02.410
- I understand you have
a young one at home

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:03.870
and you had to help him with homework.

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:07.040
How did that go? And I
think I know the answer.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.383
- My boyfriend has two kids,
he has seven year old twins.

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:13.860
So, while I am not fully
responsible for them,

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:16.713
I did sort of dive in when
the homeschooling started.

00:00:18.629 --> 00:00:19.462
(sighs)

00:00:19.462 --> 00:00:21.970
I mean, I have teachers in my family.

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:25.620
Teachers, I've always
considered to be wildly valuable

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.550
but now more than ever, it's very clear

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:33.070
that what they do is just so needed

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:36.264
because not a great teacher.

00:00:36.264 --> 00:00:39.788
- Not great at it either. (laughs)

00:00:39.788 --> 00:00:40.621
- Not great.

00:00:40.621 --> 00:00:41.460
I mean, there are just things

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:44.970
that you just sort of take for
granted as an adult, I think,

00:00:44.970 --> 00:00:48.220
and talking to my boyfriend's son,

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:50.450
I was like, it's spelled L-I-G-H-T.

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:52.337
I don't know why, it just is.

00:00:52.337 --> 00:00:55.120
- It just is and it
doesn't make any sense.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:56.710
- It's so strange, we just-

00:00:56.710 --> 00:00:58.500
- I don't know why there
are that many there's.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.990
I don't know why.

00:00:59.990 --> 00:01:01.683
- We just gotta go with it, kid.

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:06.690
So yeah, so I was not... I mean, I tried.

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:08.640
We got a little better by the end

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:10.200
and now that summer's started,

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:12.730
it's more just about reading

00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:15.190
and maintaining what they were doing.

00:01:15.190 --> 00:01:16.440
- And just keeping them entertained

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:19.693
so they don't drive
you nuts, yes. (laughs)

